NeoRider patch 0004 on top of NewGoblin 0001-0003 (gosh-sh/bee-engine v6.0.0, commit 015bc466613e7b7c41f272dc16ba0cacbf0e4d93).
- Lighter miner event polling: every 2.5 s only while a worker is alive, otherwise 10 s; last 25 instead of 100 events.
- get_miner_data also returns easy_complexity / hard_complexity (for the difficulty badge).
- benchmark_hashes(complexity, ms): performance test with the miner's own leaf hash.
License: AGPL-3.0-only (same as upstream).

